{"id":"mentira","lemma":"mentira","pos":"noun","rank":874,"glosses":["lie, trick, falsity"],"ipa":"/menˈtiɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"mentiras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/90/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-mentira.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cuándo dije una mentira?","en":"When have I told a lie?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589693","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Eso es totalmente mentira.","en":"That's a total lie.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/929674","words":[null,null,{"g":"totally"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"that's it"]]},{"text":"Es un error decir mentiras.","en":"It is wrong to tell a lie.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589767","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"error"},{"g":"to say"},null]},{"text":"Eso no sería mentira.","en":"That would not be a lie.","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Nunca digas mentiras.","en":"Never tell lies.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441998","words":[{"g":"never"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},null]}]}